        <section id="temporal-patterns">
            <h2>Temporal Patterns & Decade-by-Decade Breakdown</h2>
            <p>
                The distribution of wins across decades reveals fascinating patterns. The 2010s saw the
                greatest diversity with 10 unique composers winning, while decades like the 1970s and 2000s
                showed more concentration among repeat winners.
