                    <div class="era-title">The Silver Age</div>
                    <div class="era-years">1961 – 1980</div>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem;">
                        A transitional period introducing jazz and contemporary influences. John Barry's
                        sophisticated style brought Bond elegance. John Williams emerged as a dominant force
                        in the late 1970s with <em>Jaws</em> and <em>Star Wars</em>, signaling a new era.
                    </p>
                    <div style="margin-top: 16px;">
                        <span style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: 600;">Key Figures:</span>
                        <span style="color: var(--text-secondary);"> John Barry, John Williams, Henry Mancini, Maurice Jarre</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
                        <span style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: 600;">Unique Composers:</span>
                        <span style="color: var(--text-secondary);"> 16</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

